{"4981080": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Give Me More Missile!", "steam_appid": 4981080, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4981080/extras/9928736ee8be6a914e01dfe677fdebd9.avif?t=1786284717\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4981080/extras_big/9928736ee8be6a914e01dfe677fdebd9.webp?t=1786284717 width=1560 height=884 /></span><strong>⚓ Survive the Endless Armada</strong><br>Enemies pour in from every direction and only grow deadlier as the clock ticks. Weave through the swarm, keep your guns firing, and turn a lone boat into a one-ship armada. Every run is a race against escalating chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4981080/extras/dac189284ba0984c8c5ae3103fd3cefb.avif?t=1786284717\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4981080/extras_big/dac189284ba0984c8c5ae3103fd3cefb.avif?t=1786284717 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🔫 Build a Devastating Arsenal</strong><br>Mount weapons across your ship's hardpoints and let them fire on their own. Collect and level up dozens of weapons and projectiles — homing missiles, arcing mortars, sky-falling vertical strikes, cluster munitions, boomerangs, sea mines, and more. Every drop carries a rarity, from Common to Legendary, so no two loadouts are the same.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4981080/extras/a15bd1927b09f1f995e29f23a49628ce.avif?t=1786284717\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4981080/extras_big/a15bd1927b09f1f995e29f23a49628ce.avif?t=1786284717 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🌊 Command a Fleet of Vessels</strong><br>Unlock a roster of ships — from a ramshackle raft to war galleons, ironclads, and otherworldly voidships — each with its own stats, traits, and a unique activated ability. Pick the hull that fits your playstyle and captain it to victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>💀 Break the Bosses of the Deep</strong><br>Each stage builds to a climactic boss — ghost ships, living bio-vessels, arcane war-machines — and each defeated boss hands you a signature weapon: spreading spore plagues, collapsing gravity wells, and other run-defining tools of destruction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>⚙️ Grow Stronger Every Run</strong><br>Death is never the end. Spend salvage on permanent upgrades, chase achievements that unlock new ships and gear, and fill out a compendium of everything you've discovered. Reroll, skip, or banish level-up offers to shape the perfect build.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Set sail, survive the swarm, and become unstoppable.</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4981080/extras/9928736ee8be6a914e01dfe677fdebd9.avif?t=1786284717\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4981080/extras_big/9928736ee8be6a914e01dfe677fdebd9.webp?t=1786284717 width=1560 height=884 /></span><strong>⚓ Survive the Endless Armada</strong><br>Enemies pour in from every direction and only grow deadlier as the clock ticks. Weave through the swarm, keep your guns firing, and turn a lone boat into a one-ship armada. Every run is a race against escalating chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4981080/extras/dac189284ba0984c8c5ae3103fd3cefb.avif?t=1786284717\" da